<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss advertising pages down 9.2 pct through Oct (.</title>
<headline>Swiss advertising pages down 9.2 pct through Oct (.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advertising pages in Swiss newspapers fell 9.2 percent in the first 10 months of 1996 compared with the same period of 1995, according to figures compiled by the WEMF media tracking agency.  (pct change in pages vs year-ago)   Jan-Oct	 Oct</p>
<p> Daily/weekly newspapers		  - 9.2	 - 6.5</p>
<p>    Commercial ads			  - 7.7	 - 5.0</p>
<p>    Employment ads			 - 18.8	- 19.3</p>
<p> Free newspapers			    - 8.1	 - 0.3</p>
<p>    Commercial ads			  - 5.7	 + 2.2</p>
<p>    Employment ads			 - 30.8	- 29.8</p>
<p> Magazines				    - 0.7	+  5.8</p>
<p>    Multicolour ads			 + 3.5	+ 11.7</p>
<p>    Black and white ads		  - 10.3	 - 9.5</p>
<p> Specialised publications		 - 9.1	 - 8.8</p>
<p>    Multicolour ads			 - 4.9	 + 7.9</p>
<p>    Black and white ads		  - 10.9	- 15.9</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
